<title>USA: Access Pharmaceuticals Q3 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Access Pharmaceuticals Q3 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(unaudited)     (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					September 30	September 30</p>
<p>				     1996     1995     1996	1995</p>
<p> Total Revenues			-	45	 165	575</p>
<p> Loss after income taxes     (872)   (200)  (10,188)    (470)</p>
<p> Loss per share		 (0.03)  (0.07)    (0.35)   (0.16)</p>
